#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:5 17398a04a3c948518ae37c6306799c1c
msgid "Using SITL with AirSim"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 AirSim 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:10 f42e3285ae724311a26c5cfdfb4f9e59
msgid ""
"`AirSim <https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim>`__ is a simulator for drones, "
"cars and more, built on Unreal Engine (they also have experimental support "
"for Unity, but right now it hasn't been implemented with ArduPilot)"
msgstr ""
"`AirSim <https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim>`__ "
"是一款基于虚幻引擎构建的无人机、汽车等飞行器仿真器（他们也对 Unity 提供了实验性支持，但目前尚未与 ArduPilot 集成）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:12 416795dde9fa4703895711bc6e7d2d28
msgid ""
"It is open-source, cross-platform and provides excellent physically and "
"visually realistic simulations. It has been developed to become a platform "
"for AI research to experiment with deep learning, computer vision and "
"reinforcement learning algorithms for autonomous vehicles."
msgstr "它是开源、跨平台的，提供出色的物理和视觉逼真仿真。它被开发为 AI 研究平台，用于自主飞行器的深度学习、计算机视觉和强化学习算法实验。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:14 5b6a4b24ff40467296c572af7649cb52
msgid ""
"Currently, support for Copter & Rover vehicles has been developed in AirSim "
"& ArduPilot."
msgstr "目前，AirSim 和 ArduPilot 已支持 Copter 和 Rover 飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:16 6836630714204462b1b97c6c7e1c822e
msgid ""
"The integration been tested with both running on a single Linux machine and "
"separate machines also with Ubuntu 16.04, 18.04 as well as with AirSim "
"running in Windows 10 & ArduPilot inside WSL (Ubuntu 18.04). It is possible "
"to run AirSim on MacOS, however integration with ArduPilot hasn't been "
"tested on that."
msgstr ""
"集成测试已在单台 Linux 机器上运行以及独立机器上运行（Ubuntu 16.04、18.04）进行，以及在 Windows 10 上运行 "
"AirSim 并在 WSL（Ubuntu 18.04）内运行 ArduPilot 的情况下进行。AirSim 可以在 macOS 上运行，但与 "
"ArduPilot 的集成尚未在该平台上测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:18 31c03ea89a644f2c9e9c4ca1da819cb3
msgid ""
"AirSim is an excellent platform for testing and developing systems based on "
"Computer Vision, etc. on simulated vehicles. It's a very feature-rich "
"simulator with detailed environments and APIs (Python, C++, ROS) for "
"collecting data. See the `main Airsim Readme "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim#welcome-to-airsim>`__ for details and "
"the features available."
msgstr ""
"AirSim 是在仿真飞行器上测试和开发基于计算机视觉等技术系统的出色平台。它是一个功能非常丰富的仿真器，具有详细的环境和用于数据收集的 "
"API（Python、C++、ROS）。详情及可用功能请参阅 `AirSim 主 Readme "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim#welcome-to-airsim>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:20 9286944d78f24082a9a7bf1814d3bf63
