#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:61 64e1906ded734a87a39d2060cc2a4138
msgid "Installing AirSim"
msgstr "安装 AirSim"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:63 810e15d1dabe4900ad6b6b3f24ef5817
msgid ""
"`Binaries <https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/releases>`__ are available "
"for AirSim for Windows and Linux platforms, ``v1.3.0`` and later have "
"support for Copter and Rover included. Binaries are a quick and easy way to "
"test out the features without installing Unreal Engine, etc. Just download "
"the precompiled environments and run to get started immediately. Many "
"different types of environments are available, some notable ones include "
"LandscapeMountains, City and Neighbourhood."
msgstr ""
"AirSim 的 Windows 和 Linux 平台 `二进制文件 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/releases>`__ 已发布，``v1.3.0`` 及更高版本已包含对 "
"Copter 和 Rover "
"的支持。二进制文件是无需安装虚幻引擎即可快速测试功能的简便方式，只需下载预编译环境并运行即可立即开始。提供了许多不同类型的环境，其中值得注意的包括 "
"LandscapeMountains、City 和 Neighbourhood。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:65 6d7429e9b4614139b12a91a672725f19
msgid ""
"If you're using the binaries, then you can directly skip to `Using AirSim "
"with ArduPilot <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-with-airsim.html#using-"
"airsim-with-ardupilot>`__ section. Also see `this Readme "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/use_precompiled.md#dont-"
"have-good-gpu>`__ for some useful commandline options to improve the "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是二进制文件，可以直接跳到 `将 AirSim 与 ArduPilot 配合使用 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/sitl-with-airsim.html#using-airsim-with-"
"ardupilot>`__ 章节。另请参阅 `此 Readme "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/use_precompiled.md#dont-"
"have-good-gpu>`__ 获取一些有用的命令行选项以提高性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:67 398cb8e38eda428295a998179270f32f
msgid ""
"For development and testing out new features, you'll have to build AirSim "
"from source. The setup instructions for building from source are described "
"below."
msgstr "对于开发和测试新功能，需要从源码构建 AirSim。从源码构建的设置说明如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:72 58a80774ff6f496f97c291b78a72f269
msgid "Build on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上构建"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:74 3cd94463160e42ef91b0023a27a25dad
msgid ""
"The main page for Windows setup is `here "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md>`__, "
"but the instructions have been described below as well. Check the `FAQs on "
"the page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#faq>`__"
" if there are any problems."
msgstr ""
"Windows 设置的主页面在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md>`__，以下也提供了说明。如有问题，请查看"
" `该页面的 FAQ "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#faq>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:76 f68ea8703d2544a9a1023c70dd5b7464
msgid ""
"`Install Unreal Engine "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#install-"
"unreal-engine>`__"
msgstr ""
"`安装虚幻引擎 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#install-"
"unreal-engine>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:78 ff089f8bca254a5bb735937055d4b0a9
msgid ""
"Build AirSim - Follow the `steps on AirSim Setup "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#build-"
"airsim>`__ for Visual Studio packages and clone AirSim."
msgstr ""
"构建 AirSim - 按照 `AirSim 设置上的步骤 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_windows.md#build-"
"airsim>`__ 安装 Visual Studio 软件包并克隆 AirSim。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:80 36a8256d46124f14a7a36b639bf5a016
msgid ""
"Run ``build.cmd`` from the command line. This will create ready to use "
"plugin bits in the ``Unreal\\Plugins`` folder that can be dropped into any "
"Unreal project."
msgstr "从命令行运行 ``build.cmd``。这将在 ``Unreal\\Plugins`` 文件夹中创建可以直接放入任何虚幻项目的插件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:85 d32142e854554f86a9e02cdebc7a06e8
msgid "Build on Linux, MacOS"
msgstr "在 Linux、MacOS 上构建"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:87 f8a108e84325472aa8a29740e4733790
msgid ""
"AirSim's page on Linux & MacOS Setup is `here "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md>`__, "
"please see the FAQs if there are any problems. Note that only MacOS "
"**Catalina (10.15)** is supported."
msgstr ""
"AirSim 的 Linux 和 MacOS 设置页面在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md>`__，如有问题请查看"
" FAQ。请注意，仅支持 MacOS **Catalina（10.15）**。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:89 e291b158f5ec4f93b974830ceae9e28b
msgid ""
"`Build Unreal Engine "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md#build-"
"unreal-engine-and-airsim>`__ - After registering with Epic Games, you'll "
"need to link your Github account with this, please see this `page "
"<https://www.unrealengine.com/en-US/blog/updated-authentication-process-for-"
"connecting-epic-github-accounts>`__ on how to link it."
msgstr ""
"`构建虚幻引擎 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md#build-"
"unreal-engine-and-airsim>`__ - 向 Epic Games 注册后，您需要将 GitHub 账户与其关联，关联方法请参阅此 "
"`页面 <https://www.unrealengine.com/en-US/blog/updated-authentication-process-"
"for-connecting-epic-github-accounts>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:91 67f241935b414ef2a25790e542d85bf9
msgid "**Build AirSim**"
msgstr "**构建 AirSim**"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:93 db0399ff7b3f492ca221c8941b67f61a
msgid "Clone the repository"
msgstr "克隆仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:99 f45f401f36d54048af3812d0bb037493
msgid "Build it"
msgstr "进行构建"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:110 9514a8dd7fee4fb2bfae05a741b8eb40
msgid "Setup Unreal Environment"
msgstr "设置虚幻引擎环境"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:112 d75d0b69722e443fab01cca0ec5aeb0b
msgid ""
"Finally, you will need an Unreal project that hosts the environment for your"
" vehicles. AirSim comes with a built-in \"Blocks Environment\" which you can"
" use, or you can create your own."
msgstr "最后，您需要一个承载飞行器环境的虚幻项目。AirSim 内置了「Blocks 环境」供您使用，或者您也可以创建自己的环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:114 3d822f8031aa4ec896db0a76a1d41c44
msgid ""
"Blocks is not a very highly detailed environment to keep the repo size "
"reasonable but it's useful for various testing all the times and it is the "
"easiest way to get your feet wet in this strange land."
msgstr "Blocks 不是一个非常精细的环境（为了保持仓库大小合理），但它适合各种测试，也是在这个陌生领域入门的最简单方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:116 095fa3b6f31945ac9282024525b1d9ae
msgid ""
"See AirSim's `Blocks Setup page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/unreal_blocks.md>`__ "
"for running the environment."
msgstr ""
"参阅 AirSim 的 `Blocks 设置页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/unreal_blocks.md>`__ "
"以运行该环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:118 f6f5fd301b774bba9b62a72d25a6e397
msgid ""
"For using another environment, check the information at the end of the page."
msgstr "关于使用其他环境，请查看页面末尾的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:123 225efb19f8e946f3a21f1c0aead6ad5d
msgid "Using AirSim with ArduPilot"
msgstr "将 AirSim 与 ArduPilot 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:125 e0c18f4861fd470990a393753696f36a
msgid ""
"Make sure that you have :ref:`setup ArduPilot SITL <dev:building-the-code>`,"
" completed the Unreal Environment setup or have the binaries downloaded and "
"verified that both are working individually before proceeding. If you aren't"
" familiar with SITL, see :ref:`Examples of using SITL <dev:sitl-examples>`."
msgstr ""
"在继续之前，请确保已 :ref:`设置 ArduPilot SITL <dev:building-the-"
"code>`，完成虚幻引擎环境设置或下载了二进制文件，并验证两者单独运行均正常。如果不熟悉 SITL，请参阅 :ref:`使用 SITL 的示例 "
"<dev:sitl-examples>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:129 16890c9aacb9473f8ec50d3880a14285
msgid ""
"Running in UE Editor: Go to ``Edit->Editor Preferences``, in the ``Search`` "
"box type ``CPU`` and ensure that the ``Use Less CPU when in Background`` is "
"unchecked."
msgstr ""
"在 UE 编辑器中运行：进入 ``Edit->Editor Preferences``，在 ``Search`` 框中输入 ``CPU``，确保取消勾选"
" ``Use Less CPU when in Background``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:133 381414993f7a40a782833ee069d4f926
msgid ""
"If you're using Windows Subsystem for Linux 2 to run ArduPilot and AirSim "
"under Windows, please see https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/gsoc-2019-airsim-"
"simulator-support-for-ardupilot-sitl-part-ii/46395/5 on how to connect them."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用 Windows Subsystem for Linux 2 在 Windows 下运行 ArduPilot 并将 AirSim 也在 "
"Windows 下运行，请参阅 https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/gsoc-2019-airsim-simulator-"
"support-for-ardupilot-sitl-part-ii/46395/5 了解如何连接它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:136 d80900b9b50b43658f085b9ffe66e50c
msgid ""
"`AirSim's settings.json file "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/settings.md>`__ "
"specifies the vehicle and its various properties. See the page for the "
"options available."
msgstr ""
"`AirSim 的 settings.json 文件 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/settings.md>`__ "
"指定了飞行器及其各种属性。可用选项请参阅该页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:138 23e1e395415042a6be1b0f67b29ddfaf
msgid ""
"It's stored in at the following places- Windows: ``Documents\\AirSim``, "
"Linux: ``~/Documents/AirSim``"
msgstr "该文件存储在以下位置——Windows：``Documents\\AirSim``，Linux：``~/Documents/AirSim``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:140 d0d6531d0a1f44478923afdaeaa008f0
msgid ""
"The file is in usual JSON format. On the first startup, AirSim would create "
"``settings.json`` file with no settings."
msgstr "该文件为标准 JSON 格式。首次启动时，AirSim 会创建一个不含任何设置的 ``settings.json`` 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:145 1d73e2ccfc6744b7b6a19a1b8fc88bdf
msgid "Launch Copter SITL"
msgstr "启动 Copter SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:147 3d0e5bb1f7dd4aada7fbbb526d818acf
msgid "For using ArduCopter, the settings are as follows-"
msgstr "使用 ArduCopter 的设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:174 90fc679b735846fdb215165f9a96608e
msgid ""
"Earlier, ``SitlPort`` was used in place of ``ControlPort`` in the settings. "
"This change is applicable in the latest AirSim master & binaries `v1.3.0` "
"and later. The update is backwards-compatible so even if you're using "
"``SitlPort``, it'll work."
msgstr ""
"此前，设置中使用 ``SitlPort`` 代替 ``ControlPort``。此更改适用于最新的 AirSim master 和 `v1.3.0` "
"及更高版本的二进制文件。该更新向后兼容，即使您使用的是 ``SitlPort`` 也仍然有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:176
#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:231 ad3a6982e7fe4b4e8642612db9492712
#: c4e2a0b7be1b4834babaf0ab9b312bbf
msgid "First launch AirSim, after that launch the ArduPilot SITL using"
msgstr "首先启动 AirSim，然后使用以下命令启动 ArduPilot SITL："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:184 90de364762dc41f08ad747a9ae5e174f
msgid ""
"Initially, the editor will hang after pressing the Play button if the "
"ArduPilot SITL hasn't been started (this is due to Lock-Step Scheduling). "
"Run `sim_vehicle.py` and it should go back to normal."
msgstr ""
"最初，如果 ArduPilot SITL 尚未启动，按下 Play 按钮后编辑器将会卡死（这是由于锁步调度机制）。运行 `sim_vehicle.py`"
" 后应恢复正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:186 4f16a61d1c464491bb7bda832ea3f2d4
msgid ""
"For closing, first stop the AirSim simulation by pressing the Stop button, "
"then close ArduPilot. If ArduPilot is closed first, then UE hangs and you'll"
" need to force close it."
msgstr ""
"关闭时，先按 Stop 按钮停止 AirSim 仿真，然后再关闭 ArduPilot。如果先关闭 ArduPilot，UE 将会卡死，您需要强制关闭它。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:189 2048c4fd02fb405495322bd8c5be3e7f
msgid ""
"You can restart by just pressing the Play button and then start the "
"ArduPilot side, no need to close the Editor completely and then start it "
"again."
msgstr "您可以只按 Play 按钮然后启动 ArduPilot 一侧来重新启动，无需完全关闭编辑器后再重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:194 cbd8f0fef52348a58285a66ebd75dc61
msgid "Launch Rover SITL"
msgstr "启动 Rover SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:196 8df11c4036154f1ea836708bad5ed6e3
msgid "``settings.json`` for using ArduRover-"
msgstr "使用 ArduRover 的 ``settings.json``："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:237 f01e29654a0249f8ab139233102c84b7
msgid ""
"The other features, etc. described in this page have settings, commands and "
"files specific for Copter, but can be used for Rover as well. Certain files "
"such as scripts and ``settings.json`` will need to be modified for Rover, "
"separate settings for Rover have not been added so as to keep the page "
"managable and navigatable."
msgstr ""
"本页面描述的其他功能等具有针对 Copter 的设置、命令和文件，但也可用于 Rover。某些文件（如脚本和 ``settings.json``）需要为"
" Rover 进行修改，为保持页面简洁易读，未单独添加 Rover 的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:239 47e0286c59e0460a832ec6331fc5700b
msgid ""
"You might need to tune the vehicle for proper usage, the param files for "
"AirSim vehicles in `Tools/autotest/default_params "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/autotest/default_params>`__"
" can be modified directly, or you can create a new param file and pass its "
"location to SITL using ``--add-param-file`` option in ``sim_vehicle.py``."
msgstr ""
"您可能需要调整飞行器参数以正确使用，`Tools/autotest/default_params "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/autotest/default_params>`__"
" 中的 AirSim 飞行器参数文件可以直接修改，或者您可以创建新的参数文件，并使用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 的 ``--add-"
"param-file`` 选项将其位置传递给 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:244 bd14a37af372460c8044362f27641348
msgid "Using Lidar"
msgstr "使用激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:246 ee8e0a30f2ed4513bf6533402c8d5983
msgid ""
"See `Lidar Settings "
"<https://github.com/Microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/lidar.md>`__ for info "
"on Lidar and its properties in AirSim."
msgstr ""
"参阅 `激光雷达设置 "
"<https://github.com/Microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/lidar.md>`__ 了解 AirSim"
" 中激光雷达及其属性的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:248 055ba3001d7f4433b78d26ce482f897b
msgid "Current `settings.json` file for launching ArduCopter with Lidar"
msgstr "启动带激光雷达的 ArduCopter 的当前 `settings.json` 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:298 872384d545c747389378a5121e1e0999
msgid "Launch Copter with Lidar using"
msgstr "使用以下命令启动带激光雷达的 Copter："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:304 fd9dfeaec4cc4f078f8bc5839176c56c
msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`BendyRuler Object Avoidance <copter:common-oa-bendyruler>`"
" is used with the Lidar, the related parameters can be seen on the Wiki page"
" and should be modified as required in the ``lidar.parm`` file."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，激光雷达与 :ref:`BendyRuler 避障 <copter:common-oa-bendyruler>` 配合使用，相关参数可在 "
"wiki 页面上查看，并应在 ``lidar.parm`` 文件中根据需要进行修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:306 83c9c489c54b438ab6fa74e22c65f848
msgid ""
"You can enable the visualisation of Lidar points in the AirSim viewport by "
"setting ``DrawDebugPoints`` to ``true`` in the Lidar sensor settings. Note "
"that this can reduce FPS by a lot and maybe even cause memory problems and "
"crash in releases ``v1.3.1`` and earlier."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过在激光雷达传感器设置中将 ``DrawDebugPoints`` 设为 ``true`` 来在 AirSim "
"视口中启用激光雷达点的可视化。请注意，这可能会大幅降低 FPS，在 ``v1.3.1`` 及更早版本中甚至可能导致内存问题和崩溃。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:312 d90b21689d1f4e89b8c1031d1ae5b9b6
msgid "Using Rangefinder"
msgstr "使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:314 7740c645c14348c78f8cbb4993992b64
msgid ""
"Rangefinders in ArduPilot are called Distance Sensors in AirSim. See "
"`AirSim's Sensors page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/sensors.md#distance-"
"sensor>`__ for details, and :ref:`Rangefinder Setup <copter:common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>` for ArduPilot side information."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的测距仪在 AirSim 中称为距离传感器。详情请参阅 `AirSim 传感器页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/sensors.md#distance-"
"sensor>`__，ArduPilot 侧信息请参阅 :ref:`测距仪设置 <copter:common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:316 9a592b944e494e3cb35306bd7c4b4d2f
msgid ""
"Some example settings and parameters are shown below, to create a forward "
"and downward-facing rangefinder. Note that only sensor settings are present,"
" which can be easily inserted inplace of the ``Sensors`` element in the "
"Lidar example above."
msgstr ""
"以下是一些示例设置和参数，用于创建向前和向下的测距仪。请注意，此处仅包含传感器设置，可以直接替换上面激光雷达示例中的 ``Sensors`` 元素。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:344 2bdcb165458f4c92bdc3e07098705a9e
msgid ""
"Details on the settings fields are present in the `AirSim Sensor page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/sensors.md#distance-"
"sensor>`__. ``DrawDebugPoints`` is set to ``true`` here since it can help in"
" figuring out problems in orientation. Set ``ExternalController`` to "
"``false`` to disable sending the particular sensor data to AP while still "
"having the sensor present. This can be useful in cases where you want to use"
" your own avoidance system separate from the available ones, this setting is"
" available for Lidars and Rangefinders."
msgstr ""
"设置字段的详细信息在 `AirSim 传感器页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/sensors.md#distance-"
"sensor>`__ 中有介绍。此处将 ``DrawDebugPoints`` 设为 ``true`` 有助于排查方向问题。将 "
"``ExternalController`` 设为 ``false`` 可禁止向 AP "
"发送该传感器数据，同时该传感器仍然存在。这在您希望使用自己的避障系统而不使用已有方案时非常有用，此设置适用于激光雷达和测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:346 bb43b8069a104d6e82c498e42cca5d62
msgid ""
"To enable Rangefinder, ``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` should be set to 100 (SITL). "
"Parameters to enable both Rangefinders -"
msgstr "要启用测距仪，``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` 应设为 100（SITL）。启用两个测距仪的参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:362 e2733954b0a94238a4d9907faaaf9c77
msgid ""
"Rangefinders can be used for Obstacle Avoidance, precise altitude "
"measurement. Currently ArduPilot supports upto 10 rangefinders."
msgstr "测距仪可用于避障和精确高度测量。目前 ArduPilot 最多支持 10 个测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:367 423597dfa9f0433d9ee26efb562d3ef2
msgid "Manual Flying using RC"
msgstr "使用遥控器手动飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:369 885552db234f4aaa80a47c76079fb997
msgid "For flying manually, you need a Remote Control or RC."
msgstr "手动飞行需要遥控器（RC）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:371 25c8694b10bc480083d8b924c4f3bad7
msgid ""
"Just plug the device in the computer and it should work. See `AirSim's "
"Remote Control page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/remote_control.md>`__ "
"for details on supported devices and FAQs."
msgstr ""
"只需将设备插入计算机即可使用。支持的设备和常见问题请参阅 `AirSim 遥控器页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/remote_control.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:375 41a253c2d2fb4dd48db59efbdf2e1a3c
msgid ""
"This feature hasn't been tested properly as of now so you might need to "
"modify the Joystick file as mentioned in the page or set some RC parameters,"
" especially if using a different controller."
msgstr "此功能目前尚未经过充分测试，您可能需要按照页面中的说明修改操纵杆文件或设置一些遥控参数，特别是在使用不同控制器的情况下。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:380 779aed754b3043afb2649d3860aee8d5
msgid "Multi-Vehicle Simulation"
msgstr "多飞行器仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:382 30588b71b1814077baa94b07a2a8d618
msgid ""
"For simulating 2 copters, an example script has been added which will create"
" 2 copter instances and enable Follow mode in one of them."
msgstr "为仿真 2 架多旋翼飞行器，已添加一个示例脚本，该脚本将创建 2 个多旋翼实例，并在其中一架上启用跟随模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:384 be59064c51744c78acbe78deaff8c73d
msgid "``settings.json`` for 2 copters"
msgstr "2 架多旋翼的 ``settings.json``"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:417 e986e2e1176a466ea0091de402ee732c
msgid ""
"Press Play, cd to ardupilot directory then run the script to launch 2 copter"
" instances. You can optionally specify the IP address of the computer with "
"the GCS as the first argument, by default it'll be 127.0.0.1, meaning "
"everything is on the same computer."
msgstr ""
"按下 Play，切换到 ardupilot 目录，然后运行脚本以启动 2 个多旋翼实例。您可以选择将地面控制站所在计算机的 IP "
"地址作为第一个参数指定，默认为 127.0.0.1，表示一切都在同一台计算机上。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:424 7b4e71893e924c27a219aec98fb68544
msgid "To attach MAVProxy -"
msgstr "连接 MAVProxy："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:430 1eb6af7f884841b8a67ada86ddbff1b9
msgid ""
"This will bring up the map but with only a single vehicle, use the "
"``vehicle`` command to switch between controlling the vehicles such as with "
"``vehicle 1`` & ``vehicle 2``, after which both the vehicles should be "
"appearing on the map"
msgstr ""
"这将显示地图，但初始只有单个飞行器，使用 ``vehicle`` 命令在控制飞行器之间切换，例如 ``vehicle 1`` 和 ``vehicle "
"2``，之后两架飞行器均应出现在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:432 e98133c87e8640d8ba0f5a94d11092a2
msgid ""
"Now, you can have the first vehicle (i,e with SYSID 1) flying in Guided or "
"Auto Mission, and then takeoff the second vehicle and put it in Follow mode,"
" after which the second copter will follow the first one."
msgstr ""
"现在，您可以让第一架飞行器（即 SYSID 为 1 的飞行器）在 Guided 或 Auto "
"任务模式下飞行，然后起飞第二架飞行器并将其设为跟随模式，之后第二架多旋翼将跟随第一架。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:434 4d54ddd4e5924e859b68565b79fe4e1f
msgid ""
"For increasing the number of simulated vehicles, just modify the "
"``NCOPTERS`` variable in the script and add the settings for each individual"
" vehicle in the ``settings.json``."
msgstr ""
"要增加仿真飞行器数量，只需修改脚本中的 ``NCOPTERS`` 变量，并在 ``settings.json`` 中为每架飞行器添加相应设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:438 cc76d99984c843e3867aad0dcadf277d
msgid ""
"There can be certain problems while working on multi-vehicle simulation due "
"to networking differences between platforms such as Linux, WSL, Cygwin, etc."
" `This Discuss thread <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/simulating-2-drones-"
"with-sitl-airsim-in-windows-cygwin-wont-work/49292>`__ could be helpful in "
"such cases."
msgstr ""
"由于 Linux、WSL、Cygwin 等平台之间的网络差异，在进行多飞行器仿真时可能会遇到某些问题。`此讨论帖 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/simulating-2-drones-with-sitl-airsim-in-"
"windows-cygwin-wont-work/49292>`__ 在此类情况下可能有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:442 893fc1338a584b4ba018d24a6e5183f6
msgid ""
"The difference of 10 between the ports is important since the script is "
"launching the vehicles using the ``instance`` option which increases the "
"ports from ArduPilot's side by 10. For using different ports, modify the "
"script as required following the instructions at the end of the page for "
"specifying the ports."
msgstr ""
"端口之间相差 10 很重要，因为脚本使用 ``instance`` 选项启动飞行器，这会将 ArduPilot 侧的端口增加 "
"10。若要使用不同的端口，请按照页面末尾关于指定端口的说明修改脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:447 87a25800442f4a6d8eb360bf7e4de389
msgid "ROS with Multi-Vehicle Simulation"
msgstr "ROS 与多飞行器仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:449 f4ac033542524293b7caa38943f9ae21
msgid ""
"Using ROS for multi-vehicle tasks is a common usecase and Mavros is used for"
" working with Mavlink-based vehicles. There are some example scripts "
"demonstrating how to use Mavros with multiple vehciles in ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"使用 ROS 进行多飞行器任务是常见用例，Mavros 用于与基于 MAVLink 的飞行器配合使用。ArduPilot 中有一些示例脚本演示了如何将 "
"Mavros 与多个飞行器配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:451 c51ee316002e4eb4ab363aec75e90111
msgid ""
"First is the `multi_vehicle.sh script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Airsim/multi_vehicle.sh>`__"
" which launches multiple ArduCopter binaries with different SYSIDs and ports"
" for each vehicle. Usage is similar to the above script -"
msgstr ""
"首先是 `multi_vehicle.sh 脚本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Airsim/multi_vehicle.sh>`__，它为每架飞行器启动具有不同"
" SYSID 和端口的多个 ArduCopter 二进制文件。用法与上述脚本类似："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:458 dc1fb2b6b8c74ccd8792cbc7fefdfd37
msgid ""
"The `multi_uav_ros_sitl.launch file "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Airsim/multi_uav_ros_sitl.launch>`__"
" demonstrates how to write a launch file controlling multiple vehicles with "
"Mavros. It creates a different namespace for each drone and each drone has a"
" separate SYSID and ports according to how the script sets the variables. "
"Launching the file - ::"
msgstr ""
"`multi_uav_ros_sitl.launch 文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Airsim/multi_uav_ros_sitl.launch>`__"
" 演示了如何编写用 Mavros 控制多个飞行器的 launch 文件。它为每架无人机创建不同的命名空间，每架无人机根据脚本设置变量的方式具有单独的 "
"SYSID 和端口。启动该文件：::"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:464 a89fadf64cba4308bb566794f07bf5c5
msgid ""
"Separate MAVProxy instance can be launched for each drone by connecting to "
"the TCP ports opened by the script for each drone. The UDP ports can't be "
"used for this if Mavros is already running since Mavros will use the UDP "
"ports."
msgstr ""
"可以通过连接到脚本为每架无人机打开的 TCP 端口，为每架无人机启动单独的 MAVProxy 实例。如果 Mavros 已在运行，则不能使用 UDP "
"端口，因为 Mavros 会占用 UDP 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:466 054a1b157e324b4a903c54499d0f57ce
msgid ""
"The ``multi_vehicle.sh`` script doesn't enable the Follow Mode, but if this "
"is also needed and if all the vehicles are to be displayed on the same GCS, "
"then multicast and the Follow parameters as done in the ``follow-copter.sh``"
" script can be added."
msgstr ""
"``multi_vehicle.sh`` 脚本未启用跟随模式，但如果也需要此功能，且所有飞行器都要显示在同一地面控制站上，则可以添加多播和 "
"``follow-copter.sh`` 脚本中的跟随参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:471 d88c78255e644acb9aa8ad1de2dd2b19
msgid "Custom Environment"
msgstr "自定义环境"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:473 c492bc9259d64370bb8950cb5a6d8c84
msgid ""
"For using another environment on Windows, see `AirSim's custom env setup "
"page <https://microsoft.github.io/AirSim/docs/unreal_custenv/>`__."
msgstr ""
"要在 Windows 上使用其他环境，请参阅 `AirSim 自定义环境设置页面 "
"<https://microsoft.github.io/AirSim/docs/unreal_custenv/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:476 0bf18db161644ad891669a77f8364a33
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:478 4a663164e3f842be819307e261e94971
msgid ""
"As mentioned in the above-linked page, there is no Epic Games Launcher for "
"Linux which means that if you need to use a custom environment, you will "
"need Windows machine to do that."
msgstr ""
"如上述链接页面所述，Linux 没有 Epic Games Launcher，这意味着如果需要使用自定义环境，您需要 Windows 机器来完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:480 0b0313e7e4c4491fa5c34271a8766796
msgid ""
"The steps are the same once you have the Windows machine, after you have "
"downloaded the Unreal project, just copy the project over to your Linux "
"machine."
msgstr "一旦有了 Windows 机器，步骤相同，下载虚幻项目后，只需将项目复制到您的 Linux 机器即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:482 77c9ed0a48af405b8ce6ce72d11f1488
msgid ""
"Follow the steps till after Step 6 where you have edited the ``.uproject`` "
"file. After editing the project file, skip Step 7,8 and directly start the "
"Editor by going to UnrealEngine folder and start Unreal by running "
"``UnrealEngine/Engine/Binaries/Linux/UE4Editor``."
msgstr ""
"按照步骤执行到第 6 步（即编辑 ``.uproject`` 文件）之后。编辑项目文件后，跳过第 7、8 步，直接进入 UnrealEngine "
"文件夹，运行 ``UnrealEngine/Engine/Binaries/Linux/UE4Editor`` 启动编辑器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:484 c86d2506aa0e40deab8b2f3d0856b239
msgid ""
"When Unreal Engine prompts for opening or creating project, select Browse "
"and select your custom environment. Afterwards, continue following the Steps"
" from 9 onwards."
msgstr "当虚幻引擎提示打开或创建项目时，选择「浏览」并选择您的自定义环境。之后，继续从第 9 步起执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:488 5b97e478bb94430e8f04f0f8792bc21d
msgid ""
"When using a custom environment, it might be the case that there are "
"multiple ``Player Start`` objects. In such a case, it randomly chooses one "
"and the vehicle can start in the air and fall."
msgstr "使用自定义环境时，可能存在多个 ``Player Start`` 对象。在这种情况下，会随机选择一个，飞行器可能会在空中起始并坠落。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:490 3205d78713314c5b9583cba7ad3b51cb
msgid ""
"You'll have to delete the extra ``Player Start`` objects and leave one which"
" has to be moved to near the ground. See this excellent video by one of the "
"AirSim developers - `Unreal AirSim Setup <https://youtu.be/1oY8Qu5maQQ>`__, "
"specifically at 5:00 where it's demonstrated how to delete the objects and "
"to move the position."
msgstr ""
"您需要删除多余的 ``Player Start`` 对象，只留一个并将其移到靠近地面的位置。参阅 AirSim 开发者之一制作的这个出色视频—— "
"`Unreal AirSim 设置 <https://youtu.be/1oY8Qu5maQQ>`__，特别是 5:00 "
"处演示了如何删除对象和移动位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:495 ec45f8db38e44058b955ff3f0a97c3e8
msgid "Using AirSim APIs"
msgstr "使用 AirSim API"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:497 08d91ac629184bf89557342ed4c748a0
msgid ""
"`AirSim's APIs document "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/apis.md>`__ explains "
"the different APIs available and their usage."
msgstr ""
"`AirSim API 文档 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/apis.md>`__ 介绍了各种可用 "
"API 及其用法。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:499 84dbc4f90d2044bd9688d138fbe3e1db
msgid ""
"Currently, ArduPilot vehicles don't support controlling the movement through"
" the AirSim APIs, however any method of controlling the movement which "
"connects directly to ArduPilot rather than using AirSim’s API work, examples"
" include DroneKit & ROS with Mavros."
msgstr ""
"目前，ArduPilot 飞行器不支持通过 AirSim API 控制运动，但任何直接连接到 ArduPilot（而不是使用 AirSim "
"API）的运动控制方式均可使用，例如 DroneKit 和带 Mavros 的 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:501 f6b987cfd75e4761905784bffcbbc9c7
msgid ""
"The `Image APIs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/image_apis.md>`__ have"
" been tested to work with Copter, for some ready-to-run sample codes, see "
"the files in ``PythonClient/multirotor`` such as ``opencv_show.py``. Also, "
"any APIs which are are used to fetch information about the environment, and "
"interact with it, or even collect sensor information will work."
msgstr ""
"`图像 API "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/image_apis.md>`__ "
"已测试可与 Copter 配合使用，一些现成的示例代码请参阅 ``PythonClient/multirotor`` 中的文件，如 "
"``opencv_show.py``。此外，用于获取环境信息、与环境交互或收集传感器信息的任何 API 均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:503 99e3ec38674340efa1c934fcb304a065
msgid ""
"A ROS wrapper has also been added. See `airsim_ros_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_ros_pkgs.md>`__"
" for the ROS API, and `airsim_tutorial_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_tutorial_pkgs.md>`__"
" for tutorials. Note that limitations of controlling vehicle movement exist "
"here as well."
msgstr ""
"还添加了 ROS 封装。ROS API 请参阅 `airsim_ros_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_ros_pkgs.md>`__，教程请参阅"
" `airsim_tutorial_pkgs "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/airsim_tutorial_pkgs.md>`__。请注意，这里同样存在控制飞行器运动的限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:507 af51e87cb97141e8b495ca69a2011bdf
msgid ""
"Not all the APIs have been tested with Copter, if you find things that don't"
" work or would like to have them supported, please let us know"
msgstr "并非所有 API 都已与 Copter 测试，如果发现不可用的功能或希望获得支持，请告知我们。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:512 4cb86326c34945008aa4d3d65c5343cc
msgid "Run on different machines"
msgstr "在不同机器上运行"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:514 5dcde754e87242d4b1ce592fd125529e
msgid "Change the following in the ``settings.json`` file-"
msgstr "在 ``settings.json`` 文件中进行以下更改："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:516 513fa61b3dd64438a4de005e34bba886
msgid ""
"``UdpIp`` to the IP address of the machine running ArduPilot (Can be found "
"using ``ipconfig`` on Windows, ``ifconfig`` on Linux.)"
msgstr ""
"将 ``UdpIp`` 更改为运行 ArduPilot 的机器的 IP 地址（Windows 上使用 ``ipconfig``，Linux 上使用 "
"``ifconfig`` 查找）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:517 e7f8d17cea724a0c829a513fe2594dd0
msgid ""
"``LocalHostIp`` to the IP address of the current machine which is running "
"AirSim, specific to the network adapter being used such as Ethernet or WiFi."
" Can be set to ``0.0.0.0`` to receive messages on all networks"
msgstr ""
"将 ``LocalHostIp`` 更改为运行 AirSim 的当前机器的 IP 地址，具体取决于所使用的网络适配器（以太网或 WiFi）。可以设为 "
"``0.0.0.0`` 以接收所有网络上的消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:520 1cd23a3e7d8546a3828a89f382cc3a31
msgid ""
"Use ``-A`` argument in ``sim_vehicle.py`` (passes the arguments following it"
" to the SITL instance), followed by ``--sim-address`` to specify Airsim's IP"
" address"
msgstr ""
"在 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 中使用 ``-A`` 参数（将其后的参数传递给 SITL 实例），然后使用 ``--sim-address``"
" 指定 AirSim 的 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:522 86e4f3b6165342d29e61f5aa53beb469
msgid "An example-"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:530 97a7aced0de540d1b8389a5cbf6966d1
msgid ""
"If using Windows, you might need to disable Windows Firewall to receive "
"messages"
msgstr "如果使用 Windows，您可能需要禁用 Windows 防火墙才能接收消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:535 cebdde6f993f4cfd9da4e4d1501768e1
msgid "Using different ports"
msgstr "使用不同的端口"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:537 8bad800f94344e2ebb095d119fd3e9ae
msgid ""
"``UdpPort`` denotes the port no. which ArduPilot receives the sensor data on"
" (i.e. the port that Airsim sends the data to)"
msgstr "``UdpPort`` 表示 ArduPilot 接收传感器数据的端口号（即 AirSim 发送数据的目标端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:539 2c1b7d1d6e044de0bb7a11c990a7ae6c
msgid ""
"``ControlPort`` assigns the motor control port on which Airsim receives the "
"rotor control message"
msgstr "``ControlPort`` 指定 AirSim 接收旋翼控制消息的电机控制端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:541 b30658eb8e454b02a0d6c5bb5a97c27b
msgid ""
"``--sim-port-in`` should be equal to sensor port i.e. port specified in "
"``UdpPort``"
msgstr "``--sim-port-in`` 应等于传感器端口，即 ``UdpPort`` 中指定的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:542 4cecb837a7fd44cca49314271c8ad42f
msgid ""
"``--sim-port-out`` should be equal to motor control port i.e. port specified"
" in ``ControlPort``"
msgstr "``--sim-port-out`` 应等于电机控制端口，即 ``ControlPort`` 中指定的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:544 58def57f8966432e92b50cd4a26e10b6
msgid ""
"Similar to changing the IP address as mentioned above, use ``-A`` to pass "
"the arguments to the SITL instance. Example-"
msgstr "与上述更改 IP 地址类似，使用 ``-A`` 将参数传递给 SITL 实例。示例："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:553 8eb55fa6ac854c5aa2e659a8aa04ee96
msgid "Development Workflow"
msgstr "开发工作流程"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:555 01095234d64746898ad10de8e67b0f80
msgid ""
"AirSim's `Development Workflow page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/dev_workflow.md>`__ "
"explains the recommended setup for developing Airsim on Windows."
msgstr ""
"AirSim 的 `开发工作流程页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/dev_workflow.md>`__ "
"介绍了在 Windows 上开发 AirSim 的推荐设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:557 c0d4bb1feb234f65b1337b2a83a09fe5
msgid ""
"For Linux, make code changes in AirLib or Unreal/Plugins folder and then run"
" ``./build.sh`` to rebuild. This step also copies the build output to Blocks"
" sample project. You can then follow the steps to start Unreal Editor and "
"launch the project. When prompted about missing .so files, press Yes to "
"build it again."
msgstr ""
"对于 Linux，在 AirLib 或 Unreal/Plugins 文件夹中修改代码，然后运行 ``./build.sh`` "
"重新构建。此步骤也会将构建输出复制到 Blocks 示例项目。然后可以按照步骤启动虚幻引擎编辑器并启动项目。当提示缺少 .so "
"文件时，按「是」重新构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:560 28fce88dd0214ed39bf97c2519f2710f
msgid ""
"`Linux Troubleshooting "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md#faqs>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Linux 故障排除 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/build_linux.md#faqs>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:562 001b4c30d73c4630baaa24fdaf1d91a2
msgid ""
"`Windows FAQs "
"<https://microsoft.github.io/AirSim/docs/build_windows/#faq>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Windows 常见问题 "
"<https://microsoft.github.io/AirSim/docs/build_windows/#faq>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:564 1d1610c3d8d44c0593dc45dd47ed8508
msgid "`General FAQs <https://microsoft.github.io/AirSim/docs/faq/>`__"
msgstr "`常见问题 <https://microsoft.github.io/AirSim/docs/faq/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-airsim.rst:567 c8e523fe209d4a6289b54e89482bb699
msgid ""
"Before reporting any problems, please update the ArduPilot and AirSim "
"installations to the latest master. After updating the local AirSim "
"repository, make sure to run the commands mentioned in the `Unreal "
"Environment Setup page "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/unreal_blocks.md>`__, "
"otherwise the updates won't be reflected in the simulation."
msgstr ""
"报告任何问题之前，请先将 ArduPilot 和 AirSim 更新到最新的 master 版本。更新本地 AirSim 仓库后，请确保运行 "
"`虚幻引擎环境设置页面 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/AirSim/blob/master/docs/unreal_blocks.md>`__ "
"中提到的命令，否则更新不会反映在仿真中。"
